        "Content": "Visit dngflanaganford.ie to register your interest & to see current offers, or place an offer on this property (please note offers can be placed once your registration has been approved, subject to conditions).\r\n\r\nAn excellent two-bedroom ground floor apartment in a prime setting overlooking the Owenmore River. Beautifully presented and owner-occupied, this superb property enjoys a wonderful south-facing aspect from its generous kitchen/dining/living space, with two separate glazed doors opening onto a south-facing patio. The apartment was originally the showhouse for the scheme and finished to a higher specification throughout.\r\n\r\nThis is a well-maintained and very well-presented apartment offering bright, spacious accommodation in a highly attractive setting. The property benefits from newly fitted laminate flooring throughout, bespoke electric blinds in the living and dining room, new plumbing and fittings, and underfloor heating throughout, heated by gas-fired central heating. This property benefits from extra light as a result of its placement at the end of the block.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen is fully fitted and includes an integrated fridge freezer, integrated oven, hob and dishwasher. The apartment also benefits from a spacious shelved hot press/storage cupboard, an en-suite to the main bedroom, and a high standard of finish throughout. The property enjoys a south facing aspect which may help with heating costs.\r\n\r\nThis apartment has been owner-occupied for the past circa seven years and would suit both owner-occupiers and investors, with rental levels likely to reflect current full market rates.\r\n\r\nManagement Fee: The management company and service charges are approximately €735 per annum, covering bin collection, block insurance, landscaping and related communal costs.\r\n\r\nLocation\r\nRiver Oaks is situated in Ballisodare town centre, Sligo, in a prime position overlooking the Owenmore River. The apartment enjoys a south-facing outlook to the front patio area and convenient access to local amenities, making it an appealing home for owner-occupiers and investors alike. There are excellent facilities on site with the pharmacy, SuperValu, Post office, Bar/Restaurants and all other benefits that Ballisodare has to offer with primary and secondary schools, playing pitches etc.\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall\r\nCirca 8.51 Sqm. Finished with Laminate wood flooring.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining/Living\r\ncirca 27.24 sqm Finished with laminate wood flooring and enjoying a wonderful south-facing aspect with two separate glazed doors giving access to the south-facing patio and views of the Owenmore River. The kitchen overlooks the green area to the side and is fitted with integrated appliances. The kitchen also enjoys a stylish island bar with matching chairs. Bespoke electric blinds are fitted in the living area.\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n2.40m x 1.85m (7.87ft x 6.07ft)\r\nFinished with tiled flooring and tiled walls, comprising toilet, wash hand basin and bath area with full glazed shower screen and shower fitting.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\n2.70m x 3.70m (8.86ft x 12.14ft)\r\nFinished with carpet flooring, fitted wardrobes and en-suite.\r\n\r\nEn-suite\r\n2.20m x 1.00m (7.22ft x 3.28ft)\r\nFinished with tiled flooring and tiled walls, comprising toilet, wash hand basin with vanity unit and integrated mirror over, and a large shower area with a sliding door and fully electric shower fitted.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n2.70m x 2.50m (8.86ft x 8.20ft)\r\nFinished with carpet flooring, fitted shelving and built-in wardrobes. All bedrooms overlook the patio area to the front.\r\n\r\nHotpress\r\nStorage and shelving throughout.\r\n\r\nDirections: Eircode F91 WY93"
      },
